<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pasminco half year net profit steady.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pasminco half year net profit steady.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    36.7 vs  33.6</p>
<p>    Net			     20.2 vs  20.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Pasminco Ltd is a base metals miner and smelter.  </p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		    2.5 vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	     nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales			  620.7 vs 645.9</p>
<p>    Other income		   nil vs 6.8</p>
<p>    Tax			     16.5 vs 13.4</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		 nil vs nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
